# Assets

All art comes from the user's library:

    L=/Users/mac/.minimax/asset-library
    python3 $L/tools/image_search.py <terms>
    python3 $L/tools/gamekit.py sheet <role>    # contact sheet of real pictures

**Do not generate placeholder art when the library holds something suitable.**
If nothing fits, report that — it is a better answer than a fabricated asset.

Licence metadata is not yours to interpret. `unverified` means surface it to the
owner and let them decide.
